    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadowHouse_Text_FlowersInTheFieldsAreSpecial",
      "en_US": [
        "The flowers that grow in the fields\n",
        "here are special.\r",
        "Do you see how they’re more vivid\n",
        "than flowers elsewhere in Sinnoh?\r",
        "You can thank Pokémon for that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "FloaromaMeadowHouse_Text_RustlingTreeOftenRarePokemon",
      "en_US": [
        "If you put Honey on a tree, check\n",
        "back later to see if it’s rustling.\r",
        "If it is, it’s quite often a rare\n",
        "Pokémon.\r",
        "It gets my hopes up if I see that\n",
        "happening."
      ]
    },
